    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1.2
  m_Text: "Here you can pick up a shotgun.\nIt uses the same ammo as the machine
    gun,\nbut can't be aimed, and its magazine\ncan only contain 2 charges, \nso
    you'll need to reload it.\n\nThis can be done by pressing the <color=yellow>R
    key</color> or <color=yellow>RB</color> on a pad.\n<color=black>You can also
    create weapons that auto reload by pressing\nthe fire button again.</color>"
