  m_Text: "You can also use your weapons to do more\nthan just destroying stuff.\nThe
    target below this text box is a switch that \ncommands the moving platform to
    the right.\nHitting it will make the platform move to its destination.\nHitting
    it again will bring it back to its start position.\nFeel free to play with that
    switch, it's unbreakable.\n<color=black>Shoot the target below to move the platform.</color>"
