  m_Text: "Here is a weapon picker. \nPicking it will add a Machine Gun to your inventory,\nalong
    with 25 bullets.\n<color=black>You can then go to your inventory and <color=white>equip</color>
    it.\nTo do so, select the machine gun, then press\nthe equip button, or the <color=yellow>space
    key</color>, or the <color=yellow>A</color> button on an Xbox pad.</color>"
